{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385610/extras/d21cb469f68644943687a20a73a37124.avif?t=1755544385\" width=616 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Hidden Evidence</strong>, you play as one of four investigators hired to uncover proof of the government hiding critical information. You must work together\u2026 but not everyone is on your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative Gameplay \u2013 Team up to uncover the truth\u2026 but beware \u2013 one of you is a traitor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385610/extras/945409430e4c1eee72e186e2f87ee602.webp?t=1755544385\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385610/extras/945409430e4c1eee72e186e2f87ee602.poster.avif?t=1755544385\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=64 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secure the Evidence</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search the area and collect proof of the government\u2019s secret operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385610/extras/d23e84c718a0c71c41f1895245bee48f.poster.avif?t=1755544385\" width=616 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385610/extras/d23e84c718a0c71c41f1895245bee48f.webm?t=1755544385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385610/extras/d23e84c718a0c71c41f1895245bee48f.mp4?t=1755544385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Watch the Traitor</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The traitor has their own goals and will do whatever it takes to sabotage your mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385610/extras/66b79d530eee319b45725a40986c3c97.poster.avif?t=1755544385\" width=616 height=64 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385610/extras/66b79d530eee319b45725a40986c3c97.webm?t=1755544385\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385610/extras/66b79d530eee319b45725a40986c3c97.mp4?t=1755544385\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Proximity Voice Chat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your voice is your tool \u2014 or your risk. Sometimes, silence can save your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who can you trust when every word and move could be your last?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3385610?t=1755544385","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3385610?t=1755544385","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385610/5b61151fdf7fc2418231d52b50964c20a39c1def/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755544385","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3385610/5b61151fdf7fc2418231d52b50964c20a39c1def/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755544385","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"no